(hypersonic-glide-terminal-guidance)
*title Synthetic hypersonic lifting glide with terminal proportional navigation
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0

*trajectory 1 glider start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=80000 long=0 lat=0 vel=7000 gama=-5 psi=90 time=0 mass=500
  *file glider.dat time alt vel mach gama relrng[2] alpha cl cd
  *segment 1 phugoid-glide
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05 dtguid=2
    *inertial ecfc
    *aero cl=(hg-cl) cd=(hg-cd)
    *fly gamgd=-5
    *when time>30 goto 2

  *segment 2 terminal-pronav
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05 dtguid=2
    *inertial ecfc
    *aero cl=(hg-cl) cd=(hg-cd)
    *fly propnav=2
    *when relrng[2]<1000 stop
    *when time>120 stop

*trajectory 2 target start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20911410.350444008 y=418018.115382373 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file target.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 ground-track
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *when time=120 stop
*end
